  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 (RNA encoder) and multiprofile settings significantly improve performance over PCA and singleprofile baselines. The next experiment should test whether combining the best RNA-only configuration (scvi_n200, multiprofile, avgpool) with image data (resnet50) improves validation accuracy. This isolates the effect of multimodal integration while leveraging prior evidence about encoder and profile settings, addressing the critical uncertainty about whether adding image modality provides value."
